\*
\* PX1I caller: bounded arbitrary chunk metadata, AEAD, reassembly, verification, deadline, CONNECT gate.
\*
\* Safety claims (states and steps that must be unreachable):
\*   IdentityBufferNeverExceedsCap: no accepted metadata can grow the caller buffer beyond its bounded capacity
\*   IdentityAppendRequiresValidatedMetadata: append follows a matching total, exact offset, positive length, and in-range end
\*   IdentityPartialCannotVerify: partial accumulation cannot be returned or verified
\*   IdentityVerificationNeedsWholeBoundPayload: verification success requires the full payload and the PQ identity binding
\*   IdentityFailureBlocksConnect: EOF, AEAD, framing, signature, or deadline failure cannot send CONNECT
\*   IdentityConnectWaitsForVerification: CONNECT follows complete reassembly and successful identity verification

